From c2a589ae40dc088d07477f5a5d605ba17cee6589 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chase Payne <chase_payne@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 16:40:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] feat(driver): preserve terminal-session HDR display path

Windows kept the remote seat in SDR until the Remote IDD published its HDR wire contract and primed the qualifying source state before monitor arrival.

Keep the compile-time-gated driver path and diagnostics that produced active 10-bit HDR while removing the disproven experimental branches.

Generated with [Codex](https://openai.com/codex/)

Model: GPT 5.6-Sol X-High
